   "date": "2017-08-10",
   "stage_hint": null,
   "brief": "The Product Emissions Standards (Excise) Charges Bill 2017 imposes a charge on domestically manufactured products prescribed under product emissions standards legislation, enabling full cost recovery of regulatory costs alongside companion bills."
  },
  {
   "slug": "speech-350950",
   "speaker": "Josh Frydenberg",
   "party": "Liberal",
   "state": "federal",
   "date": "2017-08-10",
   "stage_hint": null,
   "brief": "The Product Emissions Standards (Customs) Charges Bill 2017 imposes a charge on importing products prescribed under product emissions standards legislation, enabling full cost recovery of regulation costs alongside the Excise Charges Bill and the Product Emissions Standards Bill 2017."
  },
