   "brief": "The speaker moved that the Product Emissions Standards Bill 2017, the Product Emissions Standards (Excise) Charges Bill 2017, the Product Emissions Standards (Customs) Charges Bill 2017, and the Product Emissions Standards (Consequential Provisions) Bill be referred to the Federation Chamber for further consideration."
